### System Health Live
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/system/health/live

### System Health Ready
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/system/health/ready

### Auth Register
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "API User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123456",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### Auth Login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123456"
}

### Auth Refresh
# Note: Refresh token cookie is required (handled by the client/browser/HTTP client automatically).
# Tokens are rotated on each use. If a reused token is detected, the entire family is revoked.
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Auth Current User (Replace Token)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Auth Logout
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/logout

### Workspaces - Create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Workspace"
}

### Workspaces - List
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Workspaces - Get By ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces/<workspace_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Workspaces - Update
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces/<workspace_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Workspace Name"
}

### Workspaces - List Members
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces/<workspace_id>/members
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Workspaces - Add Member
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces/<workspace_id>/members
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Workspaces - Remove Member
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/workspaces/<workspace_id>/members/<membership_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Agreements - Create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/agreements
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientWorkspaceId": "<client_workspace_id>",
  "freelancerWorkspaceId": "<freelancer_workspace_id>",
  "title": "Website Redesign",
  "scope": "Full redesign of company website",
  "currency": "USD",
  "contractAmountMinor": 500000,
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Milestones - Create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/milestones/agreements/<agreement_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Initial Deposit",
  "description": "First 25% down payment",
  "amountMinor": 250000,
  "sequence": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Milestones - List by Agreement (with pagination)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/milestones/agreements/<agreement_id>?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Milestones - Get by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/milestones/<milestone_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Milestones - Update
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/v1/milestones/<milestone_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Deposit Name"
}

### Milestones - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/milestones/<milestone_id>
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Finance - Get Wallet
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/finance/wallets/<workspace_id>?currency=USD
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

### Finance - Simulated Top-Up
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/finance/wallets/<workspace_id>/top-ups
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: <unique_uuid>

{
  "currency": "USD",
  "amountMinor": 500000
}

### Finance - Fund Milestone into Escrow
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/finance/milestones/<milestone_id>/fund
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>
Idempotency-Key: <unique_uuid>